# Local agent tooling. settings.local.json is per-developer and holds machine
# specific command allowlists; it must never be shared. Ignoring the whole
# directory rather than the one file so a future .claude/* addition cannot be
# committed by accident — the protection has to live in the REPO, not in an
# individual's global gitignore, or it does not exist for anyone who clones this.
/.claude
